1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,200
LADY IN GOLD GOWN: Because he is marrying me.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,100
LADY JULIANA: No...

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,000
LADY JULIANA: You knew this before I walked through those doors!

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,600
LADY JULIANA: You let me come here...

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,900
LADY JULIANA: You let me dress in my mother's gown...

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
LADY JULIANA: You let me believe I was walking toward my husband!
